  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Gain Margrid\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Realm of Torment Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">Abaddon's Gate</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_Information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest Information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Information\">Quest Information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest Information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Only available if you hadn't recruited <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a> before.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Make arrangements with Margrid's crew.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a> joins your party.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Speak with <a href=\"/wiki/Shifty_Lem\" title=\"Shifty Lem\">Shifty Lem</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay_(outpost)\" title=\"Nundu Bay (outpost)\"> Nundu Bay</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Margrid the Sly</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Heck of an operation you have here, friend. I've heard about your band of freebooters, and I'm here to sign up. Make a change in my life and all that. Besides, I've heard there's gold to be made, and I'm a dab hand when it comes to cold cash money. 'Course, someone's going to have to tell my <b>old mates</b> I'm not coming back. If you're willing, I'm willing. So...ready to take on another crewmember?\"</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"I don't trust corsairs, but I sense you'll be as loyal as gold...so to speak. I'll go tell your crew.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"Sorry, I don't trust anyone willing to abandon their friends for a little coin.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"Talk to my <b>old mates</b> yet? I'm eager to hoist sail and join your crew, savvy?\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Shifty Lem</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Margrid's leaving? What are we supposed to do? Ah, well. That's the way of it, I suppose...captain in fair weather empty bunk in foul. I suppose this presents someone around here an opportunity to fill the void. Hmmm. Yeah, wish her my best, stranger. Got some things to take care of...\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Margrid&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Part of Margrid's dialogue is an obvious reference to some of Captain Jack Sparrow's from the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pirates_of_the_Caribbean:_The_Curse_of_the_Black_Pearl\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\">Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl</a> movie.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008201920\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 341/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3562/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.492      1 -total\n 52.27%   12.802      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 47.12%   11.540      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n 17.30%    4.236      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n 12.02%    2.944      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n 11.68%    2.861      1 Template:Ask\n 11.08%    2.714      1 Template:No\n 10.89%    2.666      1 Template:Yes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:25711-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008201920 and revision id 2519812.\n -->\n</div>"
